      "writtenOn": "2021-06-29T13:19:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "system is a superset of public. why  do we pass both for a given api level? Relying on the order also seems a bit implicit to me, perhaps metalava should know about how these API surfaces relate?\n\n..and we also want to support module-lib. How does that  fit into this?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 400,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 401,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "9b6246e5049758c58202a08ffa5307b7ba932301",
